      "originalText": "1. CLIENTS & ANYCAST EDGE NETWORK\n• Desktop Web SPA/SSR (React 18 + TS + CSS Modules)\n• Native Mobile Apps (iOS Swift / Android Kotlin)\n• Global Anycast CDN (Cloudflare / Fastly) with WebP/AVIF On-the-Fly Transforms & Stale-While-Revalidate\n• Envoy / Kong API Gateway (mTLS, JWT ed25519 Auth, Rate Limiting, GraphQL Federation)",
